WEBVTT

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:02.297
understand and generate natural language,

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.563
which is the language that humans speak.

00:01:05.697 --> 00:01:10.397
When you are interacting with a bot
trying to book your train tickets

00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:11.697
or flight tickets,

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:16.530
when you are speaking to a voice-based
digital assistant in your phone,

00:01:16.530 --> 00:01:18.130
it's natural language processing

00:01:18.163 --> 00:01:21.697
that underpins the entire technology
that makes that work.

00:01:22.797 --> 00:01:24.063
But how does this work?

00:01:24.063 --> 00:01:25.630
How does NLP work?

00:01:25.663 --> 00:01:29.563
In a very, very basic way,

00:01:29.563 --> 00:01:31.363
it's about data.